msgid "Xfce templates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/xfce-templates.rst:6
#: a57fef60bcff437ea855d488a65ed163
msgid ""
"If you would like to use Xfce (more lightweight compared to GNOME desktop "
"environment) Linux distribution in your qubes, you can install one of the "
"available Xfce templates for :doc:`Fedora </user/templates/fedora/fedora>`, :"
"doc:`Debian </user/templates/debian/debian>`, `Gentoo <https://forum.qubes-"
"os.org/t/19007>`__ or `CentOS* <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/19006>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/xfce-templates.rst:8
#: e9a05be45efd4f52a7fee8275864ddf1
msgid ""
"\\* *The CentOS version used by this template reached* `End-of-Life in June "
"2024 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CentOS_Stream#Release_history>`__ *and "
"is no longer receiving updates. Due to a lack of specific interest at this "
"time a proposal to create a new CentOS 10 template was* `declined <https://"
"github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/9716>`__ *.*"
msgstr ""

